  A fork of WGPUI (https://github.com/Far-Beyond-Pulsar/wgpui), itself a fork
  of gpui-ce (https://github.com/gpui-ce/gpui-ce), a community fork of GPUI
  from the Zed editor (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed).
  Copyright 2022 - 2025 Zed Industries, Inc. and contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (vendor/wgpui/LICENSE-APACHE).

  Modified by the GPUI-3D contributors. Changes are marked with "GPUI-3D" in
  comments; the main ones are:
  - the UI renderer made generic over an internal GPU layer
    (src/platform/cross/hal.rs), with native Vulkan, Direct3D 12, OpenGL and
    Metal implementations next to wgpu (src/platform/cross/hal/);
  - build-time translation of the UI's WGSL shaders with naga (build.rs);
  - a backend-neutral external-rendering surface with native handles
    (src/elements/gpu_surface.rs) and the renderer backend selection
    (src/platform/cross/gpu.rs);
  - the GPUI_FRAME_DUMP frame capture used to verify the backends.

